Simplify structure: flat tasks, VOICE.md, context files

Major restructuring for clarity:
- Tasks now live in .lf/*.lf (flat, not .lf/tasks/)
- VOICE.md replaces the role system (artist/scientist)
- Context files (-c) with parent doc gathering
- New commands: install, doctor, land
- Task arguments for primary input files

The CLI becomes `lf <task> [arg] [-c files...]` instead of
`lf claude <task> -r role`. Roles are gone—VOICE.md defines
how Claude approaches all tasks.
